# Template: copy to acme.env and fill in. The acme.env file is not committed.
# Only needed with SAMBA_LETSENCRYPT=yes, see "Let's Encrypt certificate" in
# README.md.

# Cloudflare API token with the permissions Zone / DNS / Edit and
# Zone / Zone / Read, restricted to the zones of ACME_DOMAINS
CLOUDFLARE_DNS_API_TOKEN=

# Or: the path of a file in the container that holds the token (e.g. a
# Docker secret). Set one of the two, not both.
#CLOUDFLARE_DNS_API_TOKEN_FILE=/run/secrets/cloudflare_dns_api_token
